r, and usage in denominated units. Columns previous_period_rollover, previous_period_rollover_used, units_in_commitment, and units_in_overages split usage oldest-period-first: rollover starts at zero, each period consumes rollover credits then ledger commitment grants (subscription_cycle / subscription_update / etc.), then overages; previous_period_rollover_used is the USD value of rollover credits actually applied to that period\'s usage; next-period rollover follows max(0, monthly_commitment minus commitment usage in USD). Periods before the credit ledger use the first ledger commitment grant as the pool size. Extra columns fiat_charge_type and request_source map rows to the rates grid."],"FldGPl":["Build a new tool"],"Flip this on to automatically remind clients before their appointments, so they don\'t forget to show up.":["Flip this on to automatically remind clients before their appointments, so they don\'t forget to show up."],"Float":["Float"],"Flow":["Flow"],"Flow copied to your workspace successfully":["Flow copied to your workspace successfully"],"Flow not found":["Flow not found"],"Flow options":["Flow options"],"Flows":["Flows"],"Flows Agent":["Flows Agent"],"Flows node":["Flows node"],"FlpljR":["Enter your response as JSON. This will be saved and submitted with the task."],"Fm-KOc":["Name and sharing details"],"FmAJIZ":["Back to Productions"],"FmFNHl":[["0"]," To learn more, please review our <0>Privacy Policy</0>."],"FmN5me":["Resolution"],"Fms5Yq":["There are no evaluations in the selected date range. Try adjusting the date range or run new evaluations."],"Fmuekf":["Bicycle"],"FnN0QU":["Send a secondary streaming webhook including the audio data for each conversation."],"FnSb-y":["Cancel Job"],"FnY5M5":["e.g. Modern color & style in downtown Brooklyn"],"FnhO9y":["Only completed runs can be publish examples."],"FnjGAr":["Big title on the landing page."],"FnquCr":["Edited a creative"],"Fnzm0V":["Help me fix mispronounced words, garbled numbers and bad 