uestion you ask, call the suggest_quick_reply_options tool with 3-5 concise, tappable answer options so the user can reply with a single tap instead of typing. Keep the options short and mutually distinct, and always still allow a free-text answer.":["This is a guided agent-creation session for a first-time user who has no agent yet. Gather the requirements you need (purpose, audience, tone, name), then create the agent in one pass with generate_agent. Once it is created, call navigate_to_page with the new agent_id to take the user to it. Then help the user set up the agent\'s agents.md context from what you already learned (purpose, audience, tone, domain, any conventions) and save it with overwrite_string_field (target agent_md); this is the background you receive at the start of every future conversation about the agent and does not change its runtime behavior. At every step, after each question you ask, call the suggest_quick_reply_options tool with 3-5 concise, tappable answer options so the user can reply with a single tap instead of typing. Keep the options short and mutually distinct, and always still allow a free-text answer."],"This is a reserved MCP metadata key managed by the protocol. Setting it manually may cause unexpected behavior.":["This is a reserved MCP metadata key managed by the protocol. Setting it manually may cause unexpected behavior."],"This is the only location for {name}":["This is the only location for ",["name"]],"This is the selected version of your song, that will be shown in the song list. Remember to select the song you like most.":["This is the selected version of your song, that will be shown in the song list. Remember to select the song you like most."],"This is the version amended by the reviewer":["This is the version amended by the reviewer"],"This is the version you have submitted.":["This is the version you have submitted."],"This key has been created before we started tracking creation time.":["This key has been created be